nts (emma/marcus/sofia@example.com, any password) can log in; freshly registered accounts can never re-authenticate via the login form.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Viewing own listing (Marcus on prod-2) shows \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" link and no buy actions. Viewing another seller's listing (Marcus on prod-7, owned by Sofia) shows only Add to Cart / Message Seller with no seller-management controls (no Manage/Edit/Mark Sold/Delete).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No missing-field feedback shown; form just silently fails to submit\", \"actual\": \"Clicking \\\"Create Listing\\\" with no photo, title, description, price, category, or condition produced no navigation (stayed on /create-listing) but also no toast, inline error text, or aria-invalid markers anywhere on the page — the seller receives no indication of what is missing.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is type=number with min=0, blocking non-numeric text entry entirely. Submitting price=-10 with all other fields valid did not navigate away and did not create a listing (My Listings only shows the later valid submission, no stray -10 listing).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Inconsistent enforcement: some unauthenticated actions redirect/prompt, others render a blank page with no message\", \"actual\": \"While signed out: navigating to /create-listing and /cart both render a completely blank page (no content, no redirect, no sign-in prompt). In contrast, clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\" on a product correctly redirects to /login with toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\", and \\\"Message Seller\\\" opens a dialog with a disabled \\\"Log in to message\\\" button. Since /create-listing and /cart give no clear sign-in prompt or redirect, 